{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12790","headline":"送蓨县刘主簿楚 · 韩翃","name":"送蓨县刘主簿楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"起家得事平原侯，晚出都门辞旧游。\n草色连绵几千里，青骊躞蹀路旁子。\n花深近县宿河阳，竹暎春舟渡淇水。\n邺下淹留佳赏新，羣公旧日心相亲。\n金盘晓鱠朱衣鲋，玉簟霄迎翠羽人。\n王程书使前期促，他日应知举鞭速。\n寒水浮瓜五月时，把君衣袖长河曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}